Regression for LinkedHashMap model.

Verifies the basic LinkedHashMap operations (size, isEmpty,
put, get, containsKey) using JBMC's core-models.jar
LinkedHashMap implementation.

The model extends HashMap; this test confirms the inherited
implementation behaves correctly through the LinkedHashMap
public interface.
